// @wall: Eq over Bytes
// Bytes equality where BOTH operands are call results (`bytes.from_list(…)
// == bytes.from_list(…)` — gleam equality_test's bit-array rows re-based
// onto Bytes): the Eq lowers as a BinOp whose operands are heap binds,
// which the brick refuses to materialize. Scalar and List equality over
// the same shapes vote (spec/wasm_cross/ gleam_equality_matrix).
fn b(xs: List[Int]) -> Bytes = bytes.from_list(xs)
fn main() -> Unit = println(if b([1, 2]) == b([1, 2]) then "eq" else "ne")
